# Rules
- Tool calls ONLY in XML format: <execute_command>, <write_to_file>, <read_file>
- NEVER output JSON like {"name": "...", "arguments": {...}}
- Windows environment: use PowerShell syntax (New-Item, not touch/mkdir -p)
- Do not read files outside src/ and tests/
- One file per request — do not scan the project
## Project structure
- src/news_scruper/domain/ — pure logic, NO LangChain imports
- src/news_scruper/agents/ — LangChain/LangGraph only here
- src/news_scruper/infra/ — Ollama/Langfuse/DB clients
- src/news_scruper/api/ — FastAPI
- Only modify files in src/news_scruper/ and tests/